Subject: Select registry versions and shared Go dependency owners

Purpose: Give this gNMI source snapshot its registry identity and use the shared
SONiC goyang/ygot modules instead of applying their patches again in the consumer.
Select published SWSS Common 0.0.9 so gNMI and the management-framework consumer
can discover the current module without a removed draft Common version.
Only MODULE.bazel changes; Go and native source files are unchanged.

Origin: SONiC registry integration for sonic-gnmi ce49e93eb3a0cff8daf77a3092535d76265ebc3d
Source: https://github.com/securely1g/sonic-gnmi/tree/ce49e93eb3a0cff8daf77a3092535d76265ebc3d
